      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "nntp",
      "stage": "nntp_fsm",
      "description": "Except in the two areas discussed below, UTF-8 (which is a superset of US-ASCII) is mandatory, and implementations MUST NOT use any other encoding.",
